 `<section class="about-intro"><div class="w">${eb('Who we are')}<h2 style="margin-top:12px">Local knowledge. <span class="l">Thoughtful work.</span></h2><p class="lead mut" style="margin-top:20px">Red Chair Marketing is a digital marketing company for small and medium-sized businesses in Vancouver, Whistler and Squamish. Our developers, creators and marketers live and work in the Sea to Sky region, so the websites, content and campaigns we make sound like your business and reach the people who need you.</p><div class="g g3 about-values"><article class="card"><span class="chip">01</span><h3>Rooted here</h3><p class="mut" style="margin:10px 0 0">We live in the communities we market. We know the seasons, the visitors, the locals and what makes each town different, and it shows up in every brief.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="chip">02</span><h3>Made with care</h3><p class="mut" style="margin:10px 0 0">Strategy, creativity and craft in one team. We plan before we post, and we finish what we start.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="chip">03</span><h3>Better together</h3><p class="mut" style="margin:10px 0 0">You get a team, not a ticket queue: clear communication, quick replies and approvals that take a click instead of a meeting.</p></article></div></div></section>
